+/*
+ * Sflow DSA tags:
+ * CPSS CPUCode Ingress - CPSS_HAL_CTRLPKT_CPU_CODE_SAMPLE_USER_DEFINE_0 to
+ *                          CPSS_HAL_CTRLPKT_CPU_CODE_SAMPLE_USER_DEFINE_6
+ * CPSS CPUCode Egress - CPSS_HAL_CTRLPKT_CPU_CODE_SAMPLE_USER_DEFINE_7 to
